 March 2026, 14:00 Italian time — closed","deadlineDate":"2026-03-26","status":"Closed","summary":"The current call is closed. MAECI grants use an annual eligible-country list and the official Study in Italy application portal for study carried out in Italy.","tags":["Italian Government","MAECI","Study in Italy"],"source":"https://www.esteri.it/en/servizi-opportunita/opportunita/borse-di-studio/per-cittadini-stranieri/borsestudio_stranieri/","sourceLabel":"Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs","checked":"13 October 2026"},{"id":"italy-ergo-dsu-2026-27","title":"ER.GO Regional Scholarship 2026–2027","provider":"ER.GO Emilia-Romagna","type":"Scholarship","level":"Any degree","country":"Italy","region":"Europe","funding":"Funded","deadline":"24 August 2026, 16:00 — main scholarship deadline closed","deadlineDate":"2026-08-24","status":"Closed","summary":"Regional right-to-study support assessed under ER.GO's economic, enrolment and merit rules, with separate guidance for families holding income or assets abroad.","tags":["DSU","Emilia-Romagna","Income assessed"],"source":"https://www.er-go.it/cosa-fare-per/bandi-di-concorso/leggi-il-bando","sourceLabel":"ER.GO official 2026–2027 call","checked":"13 October 2026"}],"showTypeFilter":false}]]}],false,"$L1b",false,null,null]}],false]}]
