1d:["$","section","4-Keep a small, evidence-based shortlist",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep a small, evidence-based shortlist"}],[["$","p","For each option, save the official source, cycle, nationality or residence conditions, programme, required documents and deadline. Mark a condition as unconfirmed when the current source is silent. A pending call is not an open application.",{"children":"For each option, save the official source, cycle, nationality or residence conditions, programme, required documents and deadline. Mark a condition as unconfirmed when the current source is silent. A pending call is not an open application."}],["$","p","Prepare documents around the earliest dependent task. References, school nomination, programme admission and a scholarship form may have separate dates. Keep academic fit and net cost visible so a well-written application does not lead to an unaffordable offer.",{"children":"Prepare documents around the earliest dependent task. References, school nomination, programme admission and a scholarship form may have separate dates. Keep academic fit and net cost visible so a well-written application does not lead to an unaffordable offer."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Keep a small, evidence-based shortlist","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/statement-of-purpose/",{"href":"/guides/statement-of-purpose/","children":["Research-focused statement of purpose",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$14:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/recommendation-letter/",{"href":"/guides/recommendation-letter/","children":["Reference planning",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$14:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
